# links"; CMake and the iOS table generator both read it, so they cannot drift.
com.aurora.runtime.empty|aurora_module_entry_empty|EmptyModule
com.aurora.runtime.simulated|aurora_module_entry_simulated|SimulatedRuntime
com.aurora.runtime.faultinjector|aurora_module_entry_faultinjector|FaultInjector
